  "methodology": {
    "en": "Native USDC perpetuals on Hyperliquid, using both sides of verified matched trades. Labels are frozen at the preceding UTC day-end, with history starting 2026-11-07. Whale wallets had at least 1 million USDC of observed notional. Smart-money wallets had at least 10,000 USDC of observed realized P&L after reported fees, 20 non-zero realized fills and three active days. Wallet classifications may include small individual matches. Each match is counted once even when both parties qualify. Funding, other venues and unrealized P&L are excluded.",
    "zh": "覆盖 Hyperliquid 原生 USDC 永续合约。从 2026-11-07 起按 UTC 日累计，使用前一日结束时的记录判定。巨鲸为已观察累计名义成交额至少 100 万 USDC 的钱包；聪明钱为已观察扣除成交手续费后的已实现盈亏至少 1 万 USDC、至少 20 笔已实现盈亏非零的成交且至少活跃 3 天的钱包。标签适用于钱包，单笔成交可小于门槛。同一撮合只计一次。盈亏不含资金费、其他场所和未实现浮盈亏。"
  },
  "analysis": {
    "en": "The matched notional was 66,928,059,048.00 USDC. Across trades initiated by smart-money wallets, buys totaled 7,876,849,202.49 USDC (48.9%) and sells 8,235,145,845.44 USDC (51.1%). These are taker-side matched amounts. BTC represented 13.8% of qualifying matches.",
    "zh": "去重成交的名义金额合计 66,928,059,048.00 USDC。在聪明钱钱包主动成交中，主动买入 7,876,849,202.49 USDC（48.9%），主动卖出 8,235,145,845.44 USDC（51.1%）。占比按主动侧成交额计算。BTC 占全部达标撮合笔数的 13.8%。"
  },
